  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39836474",
      "title": "Adding the \"New Project\" Component & A Reusable \"Input\" Component",
      "sourceHash": "e507a9ab7c75bf22fad5662fddb7dff59e5235b05ae5be0abe6c5f507bdbd06f",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.66,
          "end": 1.71,
          "en": "So, to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 1.71,
          "end": 3.48,
          "en": "that we can add a new project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 3.48,
          "end": 8.16,
          "en": "I'll add another component, which I'll name NewProject,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.16,
          "end": 9.66,
          "en": "because that will be a component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.66,
          "end": 11.82,
          "en": "that should display all the inputs we need,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 11.82,
          "end": 14.703,
          "en": "to gather the data we need for a new project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.29,
          "end": 18.63,
          "en": "So in here, we, of course, also export",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.63,
          "end": 23.283,
          "en": "this NewProject component function as we always do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.32,
          "end": 28.02,
          "en": "And then in here, in that component function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.02,
          "end": 30.75,
          "en": "I wanna output a div.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.75,
          "end": 32.25,
          "en": "And then, in that div,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.25,
          "end": 35.43,
          "en": "I'll add a menu element here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.43,
          "end": 38.25,
          "en": "And these of course, are all built-in elements,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.25,
          "end": 39.87,
          "en": "as you can tell by the fact that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.87,
          "end": 42.183,
          "en": "they're starting with a lowercase character,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.77,
          "end": 46.773,
          "en": "which should output two buttons,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.64,
          "end": 51.093,
          "en": "a Cancel button and a Save button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.29,
          "end": 55.17,
          "en": "And below that menu, I, then, wanna have a div",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.17,
          "end": 58.68,
          "en": "with the different inputs for this project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.68,
          "end": 60.783,
          "en": "so, for these project details.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 62.64,
          "end": 65.13,
          "en": "We could, also, display a form here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.13,
          "end": 67.53,
          "en": "and, semantically, that would be a bit better.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 67.53,
          "end": 69.9,
          "en": "But, when it comes to handling forms,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 69.9,
          "end": 72.78,
          "en": "there's a bit more I wanna explore together with you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 72.78,
          "end": 73.92,
          "en": "which is why this course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 73.92,
          "end": 75.84,
          "en": "has a separate section on forms",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 75.84,
          "end": 77.16,
          "en": "and handling user input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 77.16,
          "end": 78.06,
          "en": "so that you can learn",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 78.06,
          "end": 80.64,
          "en": "about all the important things you should know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 80.64,
          "end": 83.49,
          "en": "when dealing with forms in React apps.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 83.49,
          "end": 85.35300000000001,
          "en": "Therefore, here, I'll just use a div.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 86.55,
          "end": 89.25,
          "en": "But in that div, I then wanna have a paragraph",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 89.25,
          "end": 94.053,
          "en": "which, then, has a label and an input inside of it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 95.19,
          "end": 98.03999999999999,
          "en": "And I'll then repeat this three times,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 98.03999999999999,
          "end": 100.44,
          "en": "basically, because I'll need an input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 100.44,
          "end": 104.37,
          "en": "for the title of the project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 104.37,
          "end": 107.13,
          "en": "for the description of the project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 107.13,
          "end": 111.393,
          "en": "and, also, for the due date of the project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 113.91,
          "end": 115.35,
          "en": "Though, for the description,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 115.35,
          "end": 117.21000000000001,
          "en": "I actually want a textarea",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 117.21000000000001,
          "end": 119.88,
          "en": "so that we can enter longer text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 119.88,
          "end": 123.15,
          "en": "Nonetheless, we have three pretty similar",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 123.15,
          "end": 124.773,
          "en": "JSX structures here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 126.69,
          "end": 129.21,
          "en": "And, therefore, I'll actually add yet another",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 129.21,
          "end": 132.18,
          "en": "new component, the input component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 132.18,
          "end": 134.88,
          "en": "which will wrap this structure,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 134.88,
          "end": 137.57999999999998,
          "en": "and which can, then, be reused.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 137.57999999999998,
          "end": 139.32,
          "en": "Also, so that we don't have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 139.32,
          "end": 142.863,
          "en": "to repeat the same tailwind CSS classes all the time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 144.24,
          "end": 148.14,
          "en": "Therefore, here we'll export another new function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 148.14,
          "end": 151.293,
          "en": "called Input, in this Input.jsx file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 152.57999999999998,
          "end": 156.84,
          "en": "And here, I then want to return my paragraph",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 156.84,
          "end": 158.733,
          "en": "which includes that label,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 159.99,
          "end": 164.15,
          "en": "and then either an input or a textarea.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 165.511,
          "end": 167.13,
          "en": "Therefore, this input component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 167.13,
          "end": 170.52,
          "en": "should be configurable via props,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 170.52,
          "end": 174.81,
          "en": "so that we can, for example, set a textarea",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 174.81,
          "end": 179.81,
          "en": "or isTextarea prop here when using the input component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 180.84,
          "end": 182.37,
          "en": "And if that should be true,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 182.37,
          "end": 184.29,
          "en": "we wanna render a textarea,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 184.29,
          "end": 186.843,
          "en": "otherwise, we wanna render an input element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 187.83,
          "end": 190.29,
          "en": "So, I'll just name it textarea here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 190.29,
          "end": 192.48,
          "en": "and then below this label here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 192.48,
          "end": 195.93,
          "en": "I'll check if textarea is truthy.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 195.93,
          "end": 196.98,
          "en": "And if that's the case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 196.98,
          "end": 199.14,
          "en": "I wanna output a textarea here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 199.14,
          "end": 202.11,
          "en": "otherwise, I'll output an input element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 202.11,
          "end": 203.28300000000002,
          "en": "That's the idea.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 204.42000000000002,
          "end": 206.1,
          "en": "Now, the idea also is that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 206.1,
          "end": 210.03,
          "en": "this input component also gets a label prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 210.03,
          "end": 213.183,
          "en": "which is used for setting the label like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 215.64,
          "end": 218.1,
          "en": "And, that we collect all other props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 218.1,
          "end": 219.72,
          "en": "that might be passed in",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 219.72,
          "end": 223.02,
          "en": "so that we can spread those remaining props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 223.02,
          "end": 227.763,
          "en": "onto either this textarea or our input here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 228.72,
          "end": 232.26,
          "en": "So, that textarea and input are fully configurable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 232.26,
          "end": 234.393,
          "en": "from outside this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 235.74,
          "end": 237.75,
          "en": "Now, back in NewProject,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 237.75,
          "end": 241.5,
          "en": "we can replace these three paragraphs here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 241.5,
          "end": 244.74,
          "en": "with this newly added Input component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 244.74,
          "end": 246.78,
          "en": "which, of course, therefore, must be imported",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 246.78,
          "end": 248.793,
          "en": "from the Input.jsx file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 250.11,
          "end": 252.48,
          "en": "And we just have to set different labels here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 252.48,
          "end": 254.1,
          "en": "And then of course, also make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 254.1,
          "end": 258.213,
          "en": "that we extract the different input values correctly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 259.17,
          "end": 262.593,
          "en": "And the label here for the first input is Title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 263.73,
          "end": 267.72,
          "en": "For the second input here, it's Description,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 267.72,
          "end": 270.693,
          "en": "and for the third input, it's Due Date.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 272.82,
          "end": 274.17,
          "en": "Now, for the second input,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 274.17,
          "end": 277.32,
          "en": "I, also, wanna set textarea like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 277.32,
          "end": 280.65,
          "en": "We could also set it to true, but that's redundant.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 280.65,
          "end": 282.03,
          "en": "If you just add it like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 282.03,
          "end": 284.28,
          "en": "it will also be set to true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 284.28,
          "end": 287.373,
          "en": "And, therefore here a textarea should be rendered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 288.54,
          "end": 291.99,
          "en": "So with that, we have a NewProject component here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 291.99,
          "end": 294.63,
          "en": "and even though it's not really styled yet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 294.63,
          "end": 296.67,
          "en": "I now want to use this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 296.67,
          "end": 300.663,
          "en": "in my app component to display it next to the sidebar.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 301.8,
          "end": 303.78,
          "en": "Soon it will only be displayed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 303.78,
          "end": 305.4,
          "en": "if this button was pressed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 305.4,
          "end": 308.163,
          "en": "but for the moment, I wanna always show it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 309.12,
          "end": 312.75,
          "en": "So here, we'll import the NewProject component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 312.75,
          "end": 315.423,
          "en": "from this file and then output it here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 317.52,
          "end": 320.85,
          "en": "and to make sure that it's shown next to the sidebar",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 320.85,
          "end": 322.71,
          "en": "and not below it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 322.71,
          "end": 326.58,
          "en": "I'll now, also, add the flex class to this main element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 326.58,
          "end": 329.32,
          "en": "to enable flexbox on that element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 330.93,
          "end": 333.72,
          "en": "and add a gap of eight,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 333.72,
          "end": 335.55,
          "en": "so that between these elements,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 335.55,
          "end": 339.213,
          "en": "we have a gap of 2rem here, as you can see.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 340.62,
          "end": 342.57,
          "en": "And with that, if we saved it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 342.57,
          "end": 344.13,
          "en": "you now see that the sidebar",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 344.13,
          "end": 346.47,
          "en": "does take up the available height",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 346.47,
          "end": 350.13,
          "en": "because flexbox automatically stretches it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 350.13,
          "end": 351.3,
          "en": "And you, also, see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 351.3,
          "end": 353.82,
          "en": "that we have these input elements next to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 353.82,
          "end": 355.65,
          "en": "Now of course, this is all not styled",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 355.65,
          "end": 357.363,
          "en": "but we can see it here.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
